\subsection{Definitions and mathematical statement}
\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
For the specified weak two-valued random-bond FK model at $q=2$ and its physical critical coupling, does the conditional interface law converge in bounded-Lipschitz distance, in probability over disorder, to $SLE_{16/3}$ for every sufficiently small fixed disorder and every admissible marked planar domain?

